@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "Server" as S
participant "Broadcast (All Clients)" as B

== EventResolutionState Entry ==

note over S: onEntry(): notifyPhaseObservers(EVENT_RESOLUTION) before onEntryActions()
loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver)
    S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
end
note right S: No notifyPhaseChanged(EVENT_RESOLUTION) is emitted.

== Round Events Resolution (sorted by ascending priority) ==

loop for each non-final Event
    group eventStart(type) on all EventObservers
        opt an EventObserver produces deltas
            S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
        end
    end

    S ->> B: notifyEventResolved(eventID: String, eventName: String)

    group applyEventEffect(players, eventObservers) -> emitOutcome
        loop for each affected Player (HUNT, CAVE_PAINTINGS, SHAMANIC_RITUAL, SUSTENANCE, ...)
            S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
        end
    end

    group eventEnd(type) on all EventObservers
        opt an EventObserver produces deltas
            S ->> B: notifyPlayerResourceChanged(nickname, resource, newValue, delta)
        end
    end
end

== Transition ==

note right S: transitionTo(NewRoundState) — see diagram H
@enduml